  "duration_s": 565.137931,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "校门口来了个乞丐，抱着咸菜坛子死活不撒手，校长一看当场泪崩。坛子里装的是全中国的命。一九三七年十月，长沙衣服大学临时校门口，门卫拦住了一个要往里闯的乞丐。这个乞丐蓬头垢面，胡子拉碴，衣服烂的看不出颜色，浑身一股馊味儿，怀里却死死抱着一个破咸菜坛子，像是抱着什么天大的宝贝。门卫一边推他一边骂要饭的这是学校，不是石周棚。乞丐不说话，拼了命的往里闯。这时候校长刚好从里面出来，乞丐猛的挣脱门卫，一把抓住校长的袖子，用嘶哑的几乎听不清的声音喊了一声校长，然后当着所有人的面蹲在地上放声痛哭。校长立马愣住了，他仔仔细细看了半天才认出眼前这个叫花子，竟然是清华大学物理系教授，中国核物理事业的先驱。赵忠尧，一个堂堂大教授，怎么会变成这副模样？这是得从他这一生说起。一九零二年，赵忠尧出生在浙江诸暨一个医学世家，父亲是当地有名的大夫，悬壶济世，按常理，他应该子承父业，做个安稳的医生，一辈子衣食无忧。可他偏偏没有那个年代山河破碎，他想起鲁迅先生那句话，学医，救不了中国人，国家都没了，哪来的安稳日子？他放下手术刀，拿起物理书考进东南大学物理系，又跟着恩师叶启孙进了清华大学，当上了物理系教授。在那个兵荒马乱的年代，这已经是顶好的日子了。稳定体面、饿不着。可赵忠尧偏偏不知足，他不是嫌日子不够安稳，他是嫌自己活的太安稳。那时候中国的物理水平和西方差着十万八千里，他自掏腰包凑了三年工资，跑去美国加州理工投到诺贝尔奖得主，密立根门下，密立根心疼他，特意给了他一个轻松的课题，两年就能拿博士学位，赵忠尧去主动找上门。老师，我想换个更难的题目，密立根以为他疯了，他想了想，索性出了一道公认的难题。谁也没想到，这道难题不但没难住赵钟尧，反而让他做出了一个轰动世界的发现。一九三零年，他观测到了一种特殊的符辐射。后来，人们才知道，那是正负电子湮灭时产生的辐射，这是人类历史上第一次观测到反物质产生和湮灭的现象。这个发现分量重到足以拿诺贝尔奖。可是一九三六年，诺贝尔物理学奖颁给了另一位物理学家安德森，因为他一九三二年在允始中拍到了正殿子的竞技安德森。后来亲口承认自己的研究是建立在赵忠尧工作的基础之上的。末将搬错了人，这个遗憾成了世界物理学界公认的公案。前诺贝尔物理学奖委员会主任艾克斯彭后来公开写道，赵忠尧在世界物理学家心中是实实在在的诺贝尔奖得主，可赵忠尧在乎吗？他顾不上一九三一年，他揣着一身本事回到清华，从零开始开设了中国第一个核物理课堂建立的中国第一个核物理实验室。他教出来的学生有谁？王淦昌钱三强邓稼先朱光亚、赵九章、彭焕、武王、大宠、陈方允两弹一星。圆勋里有八位出自他的门下，还有杨振宁，李政道两位诺贝尔奖得主，一个人交出了半个中国科学界，连他的学生钱伟长都说我的老师赵忠尧，才是中国原子能之父。一九三七年，北平沦陷，所有人都往南撤，赵忠尧却一个人冒着枪林弹雨折回清华，就为了实验室里那五十毫克。雷那是研究核能的关键原料，是当时全中国仅有的一点家底。他把雷庄进特制的铅桶塞进一个咸菜坛子，把自己打扮成乞丐，混进逃难的人群，一路往长沙走。一个多月一千四百多公里，他昼伏夜行风餐露宿，几乎丢掉了所有行李，唯独那个咸菜坛子，白天抱在怀里。晚上搂着睡觉，有人问他抱着什么，他不说话，只是把坛子抱得更紧。于是他有了开头那一幕，校长听完他的经历，看着他怀里那个破坛子，眼泪夺眶而出。后来，正是以这五十万豪克雷为基础，中国建立的第一个核物理实验室，培养出了一批又一批原子能专家，追根溯源，两弹一星的种子就藏在这个咸菜坛子里。一九四六年，美国在太平洋上试爆原子弹，赵忠尧受邀观看。看着那朵蘑菇云，他攥紧了拳头，中国什么时候才能有这东西？一台加具加速器，贵的惊人，国家给的经费远远不够怎么办？他做了一个让所有人没想到的决定留在美国不走了。接下来的四年，他跑遍了美国顶尖的实验室，白天学技术，晚上画图纸，核心部件，他省着钱，秘密定制，其余的全部学会准备回国自己造。一九五零年，他带着几十箱设备零部件登上了威尔逊总统号轮船准备回家，可传到日本横滨。美军冲上船，把他扣了下来，关进了监狱。他们怀疑他掌握着机密，翻来覆去的审讯，台湾方面也派人来劝他，只要去台湾，一切好商量。赵忠尧翻来覆去就一句话，我要回大陆。消息传回国内，中国政府强烈抗议国际科学界也纷纷声援关了两个多月，美国顶不住压力，只好放人。一九五零年十一月，赵忠尧终于踏上祖国的途途。他把带回来的核心部件全部上交一个零件都没留。几年时间，他带着团队造出了中国第一台质子静电加速器，后来又建成了二点五兆电子伏的加速器。正是有了他，中国才一步步拥有了原子弹、氢弹、核潜艇，才有了让世界再也不敢小看的两弹一星。可这样一位功勋卓著的老人，却在最该出成果的年纪。在一段特殊的岁月里，被怀疑被误解，错过了科研的黄金时期，他怨过吗？没有七十一岁，他重新回到和氏野一线，八十二岁，国家要建高能加速器，他再次披挂上阵，这一干就是十几年。一九九八年，九十六岁的赵忠尧平静离世，他晚年回顾自己的一生，只留下一句话，回想自己的一生经历过许多坎坷，唯一希望的就是祖国繁荣昌盛、科学发达。他生前生活极为简朴，从不争名争利。他走的时候，安静的像一滴水，落进大海。他没有诺贝尔奖，没有两弹一星功勋章，连教科书上都很难找到他的名字。可他教出的学生撑起了这个国家的脊梁。如果你也被他的事迹感动，吉利到了可以点个小红心。像他这样的科学家，还有太多太多这本国家脊梁写的就是他们有些名字不该被忘。想想你在工作，生活上遇到过不去的坎，哪可以拿起来翻一翻读一读，看看他们的故事是不是又有努力下去的动力了。这本书就在左下角链接里，欢迎关注、收藏、转发。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 1650,
      "text": "校门口来了个乞丐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2010,
      "end_ms": 4350,
      "text": "抱着咸菜坛子死活不撒手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4770,
      "end_ms": 6990,
      "text": "校长一看当场泪崩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7550,
      "end_ms": 9730,
      "text": "坛子里装的是全中国的命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10530,
      "end_ms": 11970,
      "text": "一九三七年十月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11970,
      "end_ms": 14830,
      "text": "长沙衣服大学临时校门口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15370,
      "end_ms": 18470,
      "text": "门卫拦住了一个要往里闯的乞丐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18970,
      "end_ms": 20750,
      "text": "这个乞丐蓬头垢面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21190,
      "end_ms": 22070,
      "text": "胡子拉碴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00010",
      "start_ms": 22410,
      "end_ms": 24050,
      "text": "衣服烂的看不出颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24410,
      "end_ms": 26070,
      "text": "浑身一股馊味儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26290,
      "end_ms": 29490,
      "text": "怀里却死死抱着一个破咸菜坛子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30120,
      "end_ms": 32200,
      "text": "像是抱着什么天大的宝贝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32640,
      "end_ms": 36460,
      "text": "门卫一边推他一边骂要饭的这是学校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00015",
      "start_ms": 36640,
      "end_ms": 37580,
      "text": "不是石周棚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00016",
      "start_ms": 38240,
      "end_ms": 39320,
      "text": "乞丐不说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39580,
      "end_ms": 40880,
      "text": "拼了命的往里闯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41540,
      "end_ms": 44600,
      "text": "这时候校长刚好从里面出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00019",
      "start_ms": 45060,
      "end_ms": 46800,
      "text": "乞丐猛的挣脱门卫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00020",
      "start_ms": 47040,
      "end_ms": 48900,
      "text": "一把抓住校长的袖子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00021",
      "start_ms": 49260,
      "end_ms": 53980,
      "text": "用嘶哑的几乎听不清的声音喊了一声校长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00022",
      "start_ms": 54460,
      "end_ms": 58800,
      "text": "然后当着所有人的面蹲在地上放声痛哭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00023",
      "start_ms": 58800,
      "end_ms": 60555,
      "text": "校长立马愣住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60880,
      "end_ms": 66700,
      "text": "他仔仔细细看了半天才认出眼前这个叫花子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00025",
      "start_ms": 66780,
      "end_ms": 69420,
      "text": "竟然是清华大学物理系教授，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00026",
      "start_ms": 69500,
      "end_ms": 71585,
      "text": "中国核物理事业的先驱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00027",
      "start_ms": 71910,
      "end_ms": 72545,
      "text": "赵忠尧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00028",
      "start_ms": 72870,
      "end_ms": 74255,
      "text": "一个堂堂大教授，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00029",
      "start_ms": 74630,
      "end_ms": 76225,
      "text": "怎么会变成这副模样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00030",
      "start_ms": 76750,
      "end_ms": 79365,
      "text": "这是得从他这一生说起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00031",
      "start_ms": 80370,
      "end_ms": 81325,
      "text": "一九零二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00032",
      "start_ms": 81730,
      "end_ms": 86355,
      "text": "赵忠尧出生在浙江诸暨一个医学世家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00033",
      "start_ms": 86820,
      "end_ms": 89495,
      "text": "父亲是当地有名的大夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00034",
      "start_ms": 90070,
      "end_ms": 91185,
      "text": "悬壶济世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00035",
      "start_ms": 91650,
      "end_ms": 92375,
      "text": "按常理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00036",
      "start_ms": 92770,
      "end_ms": 94395,
      "text": "他应该子承父业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00037",
      "start_ms": 94850,
      "end_ms": 96275,
      "text": "做个安稳的医生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00038",
      "start_ms": 96590,
      "end_ms": 98015,
      "text": "一辈子衣食无忧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00039",
      "start_ms": 98920,
      "end_ms": 103135,
      "text": "可他偏偏没有那个年代山河破碎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00040",
      "start_ms": 104070,
      "end_ms": 105750,
      "text": "他想起鲁迅先生那句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00041",
      "start_ms": 105890,
      "end_ms": 106310,
      "text": "学医，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00042",
      "start_ms": 106310,
      "end_ms": 107165,
      "text": "救不了中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00043",
      "start_ms": 107500,
      "end_ms": 108375,
      "text": "国家都没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00044",
      "start_ms": 108600,
      "end_ms": 109785,
      "text": "哪来的安稳日子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00045",
      "start_ms": 110270,
      "end_ms": 111415,
      "text": "他放下手术刀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00046",
      "start_ms": 111710,
      "end_ms": 114335,
      "text": "拿起物理书考进东南大学物理系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00047",
      "start_ms": 114690,
      "end_ms": 117635,
      "text": "又跟着恩师叶启孙进了清华大学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00048",
      "start_ms": 118040,
      "end_ms": 119425,
      "text": "当上了物理系教授。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00049",
      "start_ms": 120590,
      "end_ms": 122290,
      "text": "在那个兵荒马乱的年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00050",
      "start_ms": 122890,
      "end_ms": 124810,
      "text": "这已经是顶好的日子了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00051",
      "start_ms": 125570,
      "end_ms": 127870,
      "text": "稳定体面、饿不着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00052",
      "start_ms": 128670,
      "end_ms": 130490,
      "text": "可赵忠尧偏偏不知足，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00053",
      "start_ms": 131190,
      "end_ms": 133130,
      "text": "他不是嫌日子不够安稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00054",
      "start_ms": 133550,
      "end_ms": 135410,
      "text": "他是嫌自己活的太安稳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00055",
      "start_ms": 136290,
      "end_ms": 140790,
      "text": "那时候中国的物理水平和西方差着十万八千里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00056",
      "start_ms": 140870,
      "end_ms": 143770,
      "text": "他自掏腰包凑了三年工资，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00057",
      "start_ms": 144110,
      "end_ms": 148030,
      "text": "跑去美国加州理工投到诺贝尔奖得主，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00058",
      "start_ms": 148270,
      "end_ms": 149250,
      "text": "密立根门下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00059",
      "start_ms": 149250,
      "end_ms": 151580,
      "text": "密立根心疼他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00060",
      "start_ms": 151920,
      "end_ms": 154160,
      "text": "特意给了他一个轻松的课题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00061",
      "start_ms": 154780,
      "end_ms": 156560,
      "text": "两年就能拿博士学位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00062",
      "start_ms": 156740,
      "end_ms": 158400,
      "text": "赵忠尧去主动找上门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00063",
      "start_ms": 158960,
      "end_ms": 159420,
      "text": "老师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00064",
      "start_ms": 159780,
      "end_ms": 161580,
      "text": "我想换个更难的题目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00065",
      "start_ms": 162100,
      "end_ms": 163980,
      "text": "密立根以为他疯了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00066",
      "start_ms": 164380,
      "end_ms": 165240,
      "text": "他想了想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00067",
      "start_ms": 165560,
      "end_ms": 168580,
      "text": "索性出了一道公认的难题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00068",
      "start_ms": 169200,
      "end_ms": 170260,
      "text": "谁也没想到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00069",
      "start_ms": 170980,
      "end_ms": 173680,
      "text": "这道难题不但没难住赵钟尧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00070",
      "start_ms": 174040,
      "end_ms": 176840,
      "text": "反而让他做出了一个轰动世界的发现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00071",
      "start_ms": 177140,
      "end_ms": 178280,
      "text": "一九三零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00072",
      "start_ms": 178280,
      "end_ms": 180695,
      "text": "他观测到了一种特殊的符辐射。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00073",
      "start_ms": 181440,
      "end_ms": 181780,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00074",
      "start_ms": 181780,
      "end_ms": 182665,
      "text": "人们才知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00075",
      "start_ms": 182950,
      "end_ms": 186225,
      "text": "那是正负电子湮灭时产生的辐射，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00076",
      "start_ms": 186690,
      "end_ms": 192685,
      "text": "这是人类历史上第一次观测到反物质产生和湮灭的现象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00077",
      "start_ms": 193500,
      "end_ms": 197245,
      "text": "这个发现分量重到足以拿诺贝尔奖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00078",
      "start_ms": 198190,
      "end_ms": 199495,
      "text": "可是一九三六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00079",
      "start_ms": 199820,
      "end_ms": 204845,
      "text": "诺贝尔物理学奖颁给了另一位物理学家安德森，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00080",
      "start_ms": 205760,
      "end_ms": 211500,
      "text": "因为他一九三二年在允始中拍到了正殿子的竞技安德森。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00081",
      "start_ms": 211500,
      "end_ms": 218285,
      "text": "后来亲口承认自己的研究是建立在赵忠尧工作的基础之上的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00082",
      "start_ms": 219170,
      "end_ms": 220535,
      "text": "末将搬错了人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00083",
      "start_ms": 221360,
      "end_ms": 224845,
      "text": "这个遗憾成了世界物理学界公认的公案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00084",
      "start_ms": 225920,
      "end_ms": 229905,
      "text": "前诺贝尔物理学奖委员会主任艾克斯彭后来公开写道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00085",
      "start_ms": 230400,
      "end_ms": 234675,
      "text": "赵忠尧在世界物理学家心中是实实在在的诺贝尔奖得主，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00086",
      "start_ms": 235660,
      "end_ms": 236935,
      "text": "可赵忠尧在乎吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00087",
      "start_ms": 237610,
      "end_ms": 240265,
      "text": "他顾不上一九三一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00088",
      "start_ms": 240930,
      "end_ms": 243425,
      "text": "他揣着一身本事回到清华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00089",
      "start_ms": 243800,
      "end_ms": 250460,
      "text": "从零开始开设了中国第一个核物理课堂建立的中国第一个核物理实验室。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00090",
      "start_ms": 250620,
      "end_ms": 252145,
      "text": "他教出来的学生有谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00091",
      "start_ms": 252560,
      "end_ms": 260015,
      "text": "王淦昌钱三强邓稼先朱光亚、赵九章、彭焕、武王、大宠、陈方允两弹一星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00092",
      "start_ms": 260340,
      "end_ms": 263335,
      "text": "圆勋里有八位出自他的门下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00093",
      "start_ms": 263820,
      "end_ms": 264825,
      "text": "还有杨振宁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00094",
      "start_ms": 265220,
      "end_ms": 267725,
      "text": "李政道两位诺贝尔奖得主，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00095",
      "start_ms": 268160,
      "end_ms": 270735,
      "text": "一个人交出了半个中国科学界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00096",
      "start_ms": 271170,
      "end_ms": 274645,
      "text": "连他的学生钱伟长都说我的老师赵忠尧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00097",
      "start_ms": 275020,
      "end_ms": 276705,
      "text": "才是中国原子能之父。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00098",
      "start_ms": 277200,
      "end_ms": 278265,
      "text": "一九三七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00099",
      "start_ms": 278630,
      "end_ms": 279605,
      "text": "北平沦陷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00100",
      "start_ms": 280400,
      "end_ms": 281860,
      "text": "所有人都往南撤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00101",
      "start_ms": 282020,
      "end_ms": 285445,
      "text": "赵忠尧却一个人冒着枪林弹雨折回清华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00102",
      "start_ms": 285900,
      "end_ms": 287960,
      "text": "就为了实验室里那五十毫克。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00103",
      "start_ms": 287960,
      "end_ms": 291105,
      "text": "雷那是研究核能的关键原料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00104",
      "start_ms": 291670,
      "end_ms": 294615,
      "text": "是当时全中国仅有的一点家底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00105",
      "start_ms": 295380,
      "end_ms": 299725,
      "text": "他把雷庄进特制的铅桶塞进一个咸菜坛子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00106",
      "start_ms": 300140,
      "end_ms": 301860,
      "text": "把自己打扮成乞丐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00107",
      "start_ms": 302340,
      "end_ms": 304000,
      "text": "混进逃难的人群，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00108",
      "start_ms": 304360,
      "end_ms": 305655,
      "text": "一路往长沙走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00109",
      "start_ms": 306070,
      "end_ms": 308390,
      "text": "一个多月一千四百多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00110",
      "start_ms": 308830,
      "end_ms": 311450,
      "text": "他昼伏夜行风餐露宿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00111",
      "start_ms": 311890,
      "end_ms": 313790,
      "text": "几乎丢掉了所有行李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00112",
      "start_ms": 314130,
      "end_ms": 315810,
      "text": "唯独那个咸菜坛子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00113",
      "start_ms": 315890,
      "end_ms": 317130,
      "text": "白天抱在怀里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00114",
      "start_ms": 317350,
      "end_ms": 318870,
      "text": "晚上搂着睡觉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00115",
      "start_ms": 319250,
      "end_ms": 320730,
      "text": "有人问他抱着什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00116",
      "start_ms": 320790,
      "end_ms": 321550,
      "text": "他不说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00117",
      "start_ms": 321870,
      "end_ms": 323590,
      "text": "只是把坛子抱得更紧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00118",
      "start_ms": 324110,
      "end_ms": 326350,
      "text": "于是他有了开头那一幕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00119",
      "start_ms": 327010,
      "end_ms": 328550,
      "text": "校长听完他的经历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00120",
      "start_ms": 329090,
      "end_ms": 330950,
      "text": "看着他怀里那个破坛子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00121",
      "start_ms": 331290,
      "end_ms": 332930,
      "text": "眼泪夺眶而出。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00122",
      "start_ms": 333650,
      "end_ms": 334130,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00123",
      "start_ms": 334610,
      "end_ms": 337380,
      "text": "正是以这五十万豪克雷为基础，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00124",
      "start_ms": 338040,
      "end_ms": 340540,
      "text": "中国建立的第一个核物理实验室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00125",
      "start_ms": 341220,
      "end_ms": 344920,
      "text": "培养出了一批又一批原子能专家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00126",
      "start_ms": 345300,
      "end_ms": 346460,
      "text": "追根溯源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00127",
      "start_ms": 347100,
      "end_ms": 352140,
      "text": "两弹一星的种子就藏在这个咸菜坛子里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00128",
      "start_ms": 352180,
      "end_ms": 353220,
      "text": "一九四六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00129",
      "start_ms": 353460,
      "end_ms": 356100,
      "text": "美国在太平洋上试爆原子弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00130",
      "start_ms": 356100,
      "end_ms": 358200,
      "text": "赵忠尧受邀观看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00131",
      "start_ms": 358200,
      "end_ms": 359920,
      "text": "看着那朵蘑菇云，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00132",
      "start_ms": 359920,
      "end_ms": 361560,
      "text": "他攥紧了拳头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00133",
      "start_ms": 361600,
      "end_ms": 364580,
      "text": "中国什么时候才能有这东西？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00134",
      "start_ms": 364580,
      "end_ms": 366515,
      "text": "一台加具加速器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00135",
      "start_ms": 366870,
      "end_ms": 367725,
      "text": "贵的惊人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00136",
      "start_ms": 368190,
      "end_ms": 370875,
      "text": "国家给的经费远远不够怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00137",
      "start_ms": 371360,
      "end_ms": 376215,
      "text": "他做了一个让所有人没想到的决定留在美国不走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00138",
      "start_ms": 377690,
      "end_ms": 378795,
      "text": "接下来的四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00139",
      "start_ms": 379360,
      "end_ms": 381935,
      "text": "他跑遍了美国顶尖的实验室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00140",
      "start_ms": 382780,
      "end_ms": 384040,
      "text": "白天学技术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00141",
      "start_ms": 384280,
      "end_ms": 385585,
      "text": "晚上画图纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00142",
      "start_ms": 386500,
      "end_ms": 387405,
      "text": "核心部件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00143",
      "start_ms": 387670,
      "end_ms": 388475,
      "text": "他省着钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00144",
      "start_ms": 388800,
      "end_ms": 389580,
      "text": "秘密定制，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00145",
      "start_ms": 389620,
      "end_ms": 393135,
      "text": "其余的全部学会准备回国自己造。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00146",
      "start_ms": 393730,
      "end_ms": 394675,
      "text": "一九五零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00147",
      "start_ms": 394860,
      "end_ms": 401135,
      "text": "他带着几十箱设备零部件登上了威尔逊总统号轮船准备回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00148",
      "start_ms": 402150,
      "end_ms": 403605,
      "text": "可传到日本横滨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00149",
      "start_ms": 404080,
      "end_ms": 405260,
      "text": "美军冲上船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00150",
      "start_ms": 405560,
      "end_ms": 406565,
      "text": "把他扣了下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00151",
      "start_ms": 407440,
      "end_ms": 408485,
      "text": "关进了监狱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00152",
      "start_ms": 409310,
      "end_ms": 411095,
      "text": "他们怀疑他掌握着机密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00153",
      "start_ms": 411410,
      "end_ms": 412895,
      "text": "翻来覆去的审讯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00154",
      "start_ms": 413710,
      "end_ms": 415475,
      "text": "台湾方面也派人来劝他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00155",
      "start_ms": 416200,
      "end_ms": 417145,
      "text": "只要去台湾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00156",
      "start_ms": 417650,
      "end_ms": 418665,
      "text": "一切好商量。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00157",
      "start_ms": 419060,
      "end_ms": 421685,
      "text": "赵忠尧翻来覆去就一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00158",
      "start_ms": 422170,
      "end_ms": 423085,
      "text": "我要回大陆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00159",
      "start_ms": 423520,
      "end_ms": 424800,
      "text": "消息传回国内，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00160",
      "start_ms": 424820,
      "end_ms": 430735,
      "text": "中国政府强烈抗议国际科学界也纷纷声援关了两个多月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00161",
      "start_ms": 431160,
      "end_ms": 432585,
      "text": "美国顶不住压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00162",
      "start_ms": 432890,
      "end_ms": 433525,
      "text": "只好放人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00163",
      "start_ms": 434200,
      "end_ms": 435705,
      "text": "一九五零年十一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00164",
      "start_ms": 436100,
      "end_ms": 438860,
      "text": "赵忠尧终于踏上祖国的途途。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00165",
      "start_ms": 439550,
      "end_ms": 443945,
      "text": "他把带回来的核心部件全部上交一个零件都没留。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00166",
      "start_ms": 444840,
      "end_ms": 445615,
      "text": "几年时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00167",
      "start_ms": 445910,
      "end_ms": 450595,
      "text": "他带着团队造出了中国第一台质子静电加速器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00168",
      "start_ms": 451400,
      "end_ms": 455235,
      "text": "后来又建成了二点五兆电子伏的加速器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00169",
      "start_ms": 455800,
      "end_ms": 456935,
      "text": "正是有了他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00170",
      "start_ms": 457770,
      "end_ms": 462395,
      "text": "中国才一步步拥有了原子弹、氢弹、核潜艇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00171",
      "start_ms": 462830,
      "end_ms": 467125,
      "text": "才有了让世界再也不敢小看的两弹一星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00172",
      "start_ms": 468100,
      "end_ms": 470595,
      "text": "可这样一位功勋卓著的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00173",
      "start_ms": 470960,
      "end_ms": 473165,
      "text": "却在最该出成果的年纪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00174",
      "start_ms": 473910,
      "end_ms": 475705,
      "text": "在一段特殊的岁月里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00175",
      "start_ms": 476170,
      "end_ms": 478220,
      "text": "被怀疑被误解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00176",
      "start_ms": 478440,
      "end_ms": 480585,
      "text": "错过了科研的黄金时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00177",
      "start_ms": 480860,
      "end_ms": 481700,
      "text": "他怨过吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00178",
      "start_ms": 481800,
      "end_ms": 483445,
      "text": "没有七十一岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00179",
      "start_ms": 483910,
      "end_ms": 485815,
      "text": "他重新回到和氏野一线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00180",
      "start_ms": 486130,
      "end_ms": 486765,
      "text": "八十二岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00181",
      "start_ms": 487160,
      "end_ms": 488995,
      "text": "国家要建高能加速器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00182",
      "start_ms": 489480,
      "end_ms": 491425,
      "text": "他再次披挂上阵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00183",
      "start_ms": 492300,
      "end_ms": 495275,
      "text": "这一干就是十几年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00184",
      "start_ms": 496160,
      "end_ms": 497285,
      "text": "一九九八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00185",
      "start_ms": 498360,
      "end_ms": 501160,
      "text": "九十六岁的赵忠尧平静离世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00186",
      "start_ms": 501360,
      "end_ms": 503295,
      "text": "他晚年回顾自己的一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00187",
      "start_ms": 503590,
      "end_ms": 504665,
      "text": "只留下一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00188",
      "start_ms": 505190,
      "end_ms": 508285,
      "text": "回想自己的一生经历过许多坎坷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00189",
      "start_ms": 508820,
      "end_ms": 513415,
      "text": "唯一希望的就是祖国繁荣昌盛、科学发达。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00190",
      "start_ms": 513900,
      "end_ms": 516315,
      "text": "他生前生活极为简朴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00191",
      "start_ms": 516750,
      "end_ms": 518055,
      "text": "从不争名争利。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00192",
      "start_ms": 518790,
      "end_ms": 519745,
      "text": "他走的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00193",
      "start_ms": 520110,
      "end_ms": 521450,
      "text": "安静的像一滴水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00194",
      "start_ms": 521530,
      "end_ms": 522385,
      "text": "落进大海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00195",
      "start_ms": 523220,
      "end_ms": 524475,
      "text": "他没有诺贝尔奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00196",
      "start_ms": 524860,
      "end_ms": 526915,
      "text": "没有两弹一星功勋章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00197",
      "start_ms": 527420,
      "end_ms": 530225,
      "text": "连教科书上都很难找到他的名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00198",
      "start_ms": 531070,
      "end_ms": 534345,
      "text": "可他教出的学生撑起了这个国家的脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00199",
      "start_ms": 535280,
      "end_ms": 537700,
      "text": "如果你也被他的事迹感动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00200",
      "start_ms": 537800,
      "end_ms": 539705,
      "text": "吉利到了可以点个小红心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00201",
      "start_ms": 540250,
      "end_ms": 541610,
      "text": "像他这样的科学家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00202",
      "start_ms": 541810,
      "end_ms": 548165,
      "text": "还有太多太多这本国家脊梁写的就是他们有些名字不该被忘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00203",
      "start_ms": 549070,
      "end_ms": 550225,
      "text": "想想你在工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00204",
      "start_ms": 550630,
      "end_ms": 552410,
      "text": "生活上遇到过不去的坎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00205",
      "start_ms": 552470,
      "end_ms": 555475,
      "text": "哪可以拿起来翻一翻读一读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00206",
      "start_ms": 555900,
      "end_ms": 559175,
      "text": "看看他们的故事是不是又有努力下去的动力了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00207",
      "start_ms": 559870,
      "end_ms": 562285,
      "text": "这本书就在左下角链接里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1c3a47f2eb6e852b_s00208",
      "start_ms": 562850,
      "end_ms": 564915,
      "text": "欢迎关注、收藏、转发。"
    }
  ],
